        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ 6300 Series Heavy Duty Rim Exit Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nHeavy duty rim exit device for  use on medium and high traffic commercial, hospitality, institutional applications. Suitable for all doors (aluminum, hollow metal, or wood), durable enough for the most demanding applications. Available in your choice of Satin Stainless Steel, Polished Brass, Satin Brass, Oil Rubbed Bronze or Satin Chrome finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor <b>30\" - 36\" Wide Doors</b>, furnished standard with sex nuts. Listed by U.L./U.L.C. and comply with U.L. 10C and UBC 7-2 (1997) for positive pressure. ANSI/BHMA <b>Certified Grade 1</b>, A156.3 2001 Exit Devices. Non-handed. reversible for left or right hand doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Meets requirements of the <b>Buy American Act</b>. ADA compliant and ICC/ANSI 117.1 for accessible and usable buildings. Compliant with the 2014 Florida Building Code, which include a High Velocity Hurricane Zone (HVHZ) Product Approval: FL 21376\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> for PDQ 6300 Series Rim Exit Device\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Chassis:</b> Cadmium plated steel</li>\r\n<li><b>Rail:</b> Extruded aluminum</li>\r\n<li><b>Touch Pad:</b> Stainless steel, 18\" wide</li>\r\n<li><b>Latch Bolt:</b> Stainless steel dead locking with 3/4\" throw</li>\r\n<li><b>Projection:</b> 3-1/8” projection / 1-5/8” projection when dogged</li>\r\n<li><b>Hand:</b> Device is non-handed</li>\r\n<li><b>Dogging:</b> Hex key dogging</li>\r\n<li><b>Application:</b> Rim  (8'0\" tall door standard) / Covers 161 door prep</li>\r\n<li><b>Stile Width:</b> 4-1/4\" minimum</li>\r\n<li><b>Door Thickness:</b> 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><b>Door Width:</b> Standard for 2'6\" to 3'0\" door (30\" - 36\" wide door)</li>\r\n<li><b>Certifications:</b> U.L./U.L.C. listed for “Panic” hardware  labeled for up to 3 hour for 4’0” x 8’0” maximum single, 8’0” x 8’0”\r\nmaximum pairs / Complies with U.L. 10C and UBC 7.2 (1997).  ANSI/BHMA Certified Grade 1, A156.3 2001 Exit Devices.</li>\r\n<li><b>Warranty:</b> Ten (10) year limited warranty mechanical components</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/6300R-template.pdf?v=1704262246\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 6300R Installation Template  (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Heavy Duty Rim Exit Device, PDQ 6300R",
                "description": "PDQ American Eagle 6300 Series Heavy duty rim exit device for  use on medium and high traffic commercial, hospitality, institutional applications. Suitable for all doors (aluminum, hollow metal, or wood), durable enough for the most demanding applications. Available in your choice of Satin Chrome, Polished Brass, Satin Brass, Satin Stainless Steel or Oil Rubbed Bronze finish.",
